      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她仰头对着天空发出懊悔的咆哮。\n吼声猛烈地响彻四周，扩散至远方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0b650309dafc0acf14fb12ce7a2ce9dc75a0db1ce42cb477bcfc4f6b8249ff",
